  ('deepti-chadha', $pvg$Deepti Chadha$pvg$, $pvg$Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Deepti Chadha$pvg$, $pvg$Extraordinary service.fully satisfied with the product and warm and hospitable staff.will highly recommend to everyone.will definitely come back when needed.cheers to the staff.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/deepti-chadha-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Deepti Chadha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/deepti-chadha/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 1, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('prasant-mishrra-2', $pvg$Prasant Mishrra$pvg$, $pvg$Raigarh, Chhattisgarah$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Prasant Mishrra$pvg$, $pvg$Dear Vikash ji, I liked the Emerald stone . Though my budget was really tight, I could get a Certified Zambian Emerald . It took a little time for me to decide but the photos & video sent by you really helped . Thanks for the same . Surely I Will meet you, once come down to Delhi . Regards, Prasant Mishrra.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/prasant-mishrra-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Prasant Mishrra$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/prasant-mishrra-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 2, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('rajesh-2', $pvg$Rajesh$pvg$, $pvg$DWARKA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Rajesh$pvg$, $pvg$I have purchased a yellow sapphire for astrological purpose. The Gemstone was pure and I was really helped by Mr.Vikas in selection of gem and also guided the process how to wear it(mantra etc). It really shown benefit to me after wearing. Mr Vikas and his staff was really helpful. I would surely recommend him.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/rajesh-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Rajesh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/rajesh-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 3, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('ajaz-ahmad-kapra-2', $pvg$Ajaz Ahmad Kapra$pvg$, $pvg$Kashmir$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Ajaz Ahmad Kapra$pvg$, $pvg$I like pure vedic gemstones so much, bcoz they sell 100% pure natural untreated and unheated gemstone, in market today so many companies sell fake gemstones in the name of natural gemstones, but pure vedic gems are genuine and trust worthy company, I bought so many gemstones from pure vedic, through online I read about pure vedic on the website, I like pure vedic gems very much.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/ajaz-ahmad-kapra-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Ajaz Ahmad Kapra$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/ajaz-ahmad-kapra-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 4, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('sunil-verma-2', $pvg$Sunil Verma$pvg$, $pvg$Samba, Jammu$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sunil Verma$pvg$, $pvg$I am very thankful to pure vedic gems that they provide me very high quality natural astrological gems at a very reasonable price I have talked to many other gemstone sellers but the stone available at pure vedic gems costing 30000/_ other sellers have prise 100000/_of that same product Pure vedic gems are the best gemstone seller in our country.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sunil-verma-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sunil Verma$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sunil-verma-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 5, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('gaurav-shahare-2', $pvg$Gaurav Shahare$pvg$, $pvg$Dubai$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Gaurav Shahare$pvg$, $pvg$Hi, this was my first deal with Vedic gems and I must say 100 % customer satisfaction. The astro consultation, gemstone guidance and even after sales follow up by Vikas ji, is simply very professional yet friendly. I would for sure highly commend the job done by Vedic gems and refer to all my friends & family.
My Best Regards to Vikas Ji. Thankyou.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/gaurav-shahare-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Gaurav Shahare$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/gaurav-shahare-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 6, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('muralikrishna-2', $pvg$MuraliKrishna$pvg$, $pvg$Karnataka$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by MuraliKrishna$pvg$, $pvg$Good quality at reasonable price. Good service.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/muralikrishna-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from MuraliKrishna$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/muralikrishna-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 7, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
