  ('nippy-singh', $pvg$Nippy Singh$pvg$, $pvg$Sukhdev Vihar, New Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Nippy Singh$pvg$, $pvg$Genuine products & excellent service. The website is so informative and precise.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/nippy-singh-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Nippy Singh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/nippy-singh/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 9, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('veer-bhan-2', $pvg$Veer Bhan$pvg$, $pvg$SBM CIVIL LINE DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Veer Bhan$pvg$, $pvg$Buy the Yellow Sapphire last 2 Months now use that is very effective.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/veer-bhan-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Veer Bhan$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/veer-bhan-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 10, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('anand-2', $pvg$Anand$pvg$, $pvg$New Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Anand$pvg$, $pvg$Life speeds up for me when I wear the Natural Energized Ruby Gemstone bought from Vikas ji, I feel more energized and active. When emotional situations show up, I`m not deluded about what the real issues actually are. My Ruby gemstone shows me clearly what I have to address. I move quickly beyond the emotional issue with the help of Ruby. Thank you Vikas ji (Pure Vedic Gems).$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/anand-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Anand$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/anand-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 11, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('rabindra-narayan-sahu', $pvg$Rabindra Narayan Sahu$pvg$, $pvg$Noida, UP$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Rabindra Narayan Sahu$pvg$, $pvg$Excellent Service, Value For Money, Great Knowledge About the Gem Stones, 100% Satisfaction... They share all related details with the customers while dealing... Thanks!!$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/rabindra-narayan-sahu-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Rabindra Narayan Sahu$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/rabindra-narayan-sahu/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 12, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('sandy-2', $pvg$Sandy$pvg$, $pvg$Punjab$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sandy$pvg$, $pvg$Hi! I bought an Emerald online recently from Pure Vedic Gems but their Pandit ji rejected emerald and suggested me Gomedh instead, after seeing my horoscope. I was puzzled that I had made the payment but when I called to their support team they easily agreed to change the product (as it was not shipped yet) and returned extra Rs.1400 inside delivery box which I paid extra on first emerald. I am very thankful and appreciate to all team members of Pure Vedic Gems. I will definitely buy and recommend everyone to buy from them. Thank you.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sandy-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sandy$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sandy-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 13, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('jayant-ahlawat-2', $pvg$Jayant Ahlawat$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Jayant Ahlawat$pvg$, $pvg$Referring my clients to Purevedicgems over the last five years has been joyful, successful and easy.$pvg$, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/jayant-ahlawat-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 14, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('samapan-sarkar', $pvg$Samapan Sarkar$pvg$, $pvg$New Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Samapan Sarkar$pvg$, $pvg$Great Customer Service. Reliable and Proper calculations provided. Most honest opinion of which gemstones and which properties they hold are provided. Value for money. Candid conversation and not purely professional interaction where you get things over and done with.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/samapan-sarkar-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Samapan Sarkar$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/samapan-sarkar/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 15, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('kusum-2', $pvg$Kusum$pvg$, $pvg$New Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Kusum$pvg$, $pvg$My experience at Pure Vedic Gems has been one of the best as compared to any other showrooms. Excellent Quality, price and wonderful designs. Highly recommended to anyone looking for Genuine and reliable gems and jewellery showroom.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/kusum-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Kusum$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/kusum-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 16, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('harsh-behl-2', $pvg$Harsh Behl$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Harsh Behl$pvg$, $pvg$Over the past decade, I have referred many clients and students to Mr Vikash for Jyotish quality gemstones. I have great confidence in his ability and integrity in providing good service and guaranteed customer satisfaction with his work.$pvg$, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/harsh-behl-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 17, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('tim-2', $pvg$Tim$pvg$, $pvg$Tai Po, Hong Kong$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Tim$pvg$, $pvg$I have found Vikas to be always very polite, helpful and reliable. His gemstone products are good quality and well set. The site allows flexibility in viewing from a distance. More importantly, especially when buying gems, I feel I can trust him fully. He comes highly recommended.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/tim-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Tim$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/tim-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 18, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('kishore-kunal', $pvg$Kishore Kunal$pvg$, $pvg$Jharkhand$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Kishore Kunal$pvg$, $pvg$Mr. Vikas is a thorough professional and a good human being with thorough idea on the product he deals in. Any clarification or questions are proactively answered. Services rendered is done considering ones need as a priority not by prioritising his business. The product obtained is of a high quality and at a good price. I will recommend PURE VEDIC GEMS to everyone I know. All the best for all your endeavour Vikas Ji.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/kishore-kunal-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Kishore Kunal$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/kishore-kunal/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 19, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('anup-kumar-singh', $pvg$Anup Kumar Singh$pvg$, $pvg$Delhi$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Anup Kumar Singh$pvg$, $pvg$I have recently bought an Opal. I am very happy with my purchase. Picture and video on website exactly represent the gemstone.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/anup-kumar-singh-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Anup Kumar Singh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/anup-kumar-singh/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 20, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('namrata-sharma-2', $pvg$Namrata Sharma$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Namrata Sharma$pvg$, $pvg$Great Knowledge about Astrology and the remedies by gems, mantras and pujas at Pure Vedic Gems. I got a very satisfactory reading of my horoscope done. Pandit ji at Pure Vedic Gems explained to me in detail about the weaknesses and strengths in my horoscope which i too could relate with my actual life.
I got a yellow sapphire and a pearl made from Pure Vedic Gems. I found the prices of these gems highly satisfactory. Thank you Mr. Mehra.$pvg$, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/namrata-sharma-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 21, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('amita-goswami-2', $pvg$Amita Goswami$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Amita Goswami$pvg$, $pvg$I was looking for an Emerald for myself. Had visited many places but was not satisfied with quality at some and prices at the other.
Mr. Vikas seemed to have good knowlegde about the Emeralds qualities that are fit for Astrological purpose. He explained me in detail about the kinds of flaws that should not be there in Emeralds for astrological purpose. And he also explained me about the various treatments coming in the gemstones now a days. I felt quite satisfied with his knowlede on gems and the prices as well.
I got a 7 ratti emerald ring made from him. Thank you. Will recommend all my friends and family to Pure Vedic Gems.$pvg$, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/amita-goswami-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 22, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('daljeet-2', $pvg$Daljeet$pvg$, $pvg$Calcutta, West Bengal$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Daljeet$pvg$, $pvg$I was looking for a yellow sapphire for myself. I went to many places but felt most satisfied with the knowledge, prices and quality of gemstones at Pure Vedic Gems. They have a good collection of quality gemstones and I found their prices quite reasonable also. The best thing is that all their gemstones are certified by the Govt. Lab (IGI) and I have heard that most of the gemstones sellers are giving private lab certificates (Which are manipulated and cannot be trusted). They also made it into a very nice gold ring according to my taste within 3 days. And also gave me the wearing procedure with the mantra and puja to be followed for wearing that pukhraj. I highly recommend them to everyone who are looking for genuine gemstones at genuine prices.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/daljeet-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Daljeet$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/daljeet-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 23, '2016-03-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('sibsankardatta', $pvg$Sibsankar Datta$pvg$, $pvg$Calcutta, West Bengal$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sibsankar Datta$pvg$, $pvg$<p style=\"text-align: left;\">I am extremely happy with the service provided. Regarding the item purchased, i.e. Yellow Topaz, I am extremely happy with the look and packing of the item. However, the astrological benefits will take some time I believe. Thus, regarding effectiveness of the product from PureVedicGems, it is too early to comment upon. However, I am highly satisfied on the service of PureVedicGems and on the apparant look of the item bought. In the days to come, in case effectiveness is established, myself and my family members will definitely recommend to all our friends & relatives, which is a very large network of people.</p>$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sibsankardatta-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sibsankar Datta$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sibsankardatta/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 24, '2016-03-28T00:00:00Z'),
  ('arun', $pvg$Arun$pvg$, $pvg$Faridabad$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Arun$pvg$, $pvg$Recently purchased a Yellow Topaz, Freshwater Pearl & Rudrakshas for astrological purpose. The Gemstone were clean & bright (appealing to eyes). Vikas ji & his staff were quite helpful in selecting the same. But what I liked most was the way Vikas ji helps his clients to basically understand how the gemstone works & it is really very important for common people to understand it otherwise people very easily can get CHEATED in selection of gems & that is what is basically happening in most of the cases. Secondly testing done by them through Govt. Recognized Reputed Laboratory is another comforting factor, which normally other gemstone dealers do through Private & Non recognized Labs where there are always chances to manipulate the reports. Another great thing they have done is that they have provided very valuable information on their Website for a common person to understand what kind of gems are really effective for astrological purpose which helps a lot in clearing doubts from one\\â€™s mind. Though I do have to wait for the results of the gemstone as it will take some time. As I also have done a lot of research in the market, Vikas ji please keep up your good work by making people understand the DIFFERENCE between RIGHT & WRONG. I highly recommend Pure Vedic Gems for their genuine approach$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/arun-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Arun$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/arun/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 25, '2016-05-23T00:00:00Z'),
  ('mridul-baruah', $pvg$Mridul Baruah$pvg$, $pvg$Dibrugarh, Assam$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Mridul Baruah$pvg$, $pvg$Pure Vedic Gems customer service is very good. They respond to public queries very promptly. I purchased one Ruby and one Emerald. The gemstones were delivered well before time. Gemstones were of very good quality. Hope to purchase from them in the near future.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/mridul-baruah-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Mridul Baruah$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/mridul-baruah/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 26, '2016-06-30T00:00:00Z'),
  ('arun-kaul', $pvg$Arun Kaul$pvg$, $pvg$Faridabad$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Arun Kaul$pvg$, $pvg$I purchased an Opal gemstone from Pure Vedic Gems and it was of a nice quality displaying various colours beautifully, the ring also was beautifully crafted. I must say that dealing with Pure Vedic gems is a delightful experience for me atleast$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/arun-kaul-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Arun Kaul$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/arun-kaul/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 27, '2016-07-04T00:00:00Z'),
  ('kamna-swami', $pvg$Kamna Swami$pvg$, $pvg$Dwarka$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Kamna Swami$pvg$, $pvg$Good collection and services. Fast delivery of product.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/kamna-swami-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Kamna Swami$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/kamna-swami/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 28, '2016-08-01T00:00:00Z'),
  ('monisha', $pvg$Monisha$pvg$, $pvg$Guwahati$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Monisha$pvg$, $pvg$Pure Vedic Gems offers certified Jyotish quality gemstones and rudrakshas at very reasonable prices, depending on the budget of the person. Vikashji was very helpful and guided me in selecting the Ruby, golden topaz and rudrakshas. I highly recommend PureVedic Gems and will continue to purchase gemstones in the future too. Thanks !$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/monisha-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Monisha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/monisha/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 29, '2016-09-12T00:00:00Z'),
  ('roopesh', $pvg$Roopesh$pvg$, $pvg$thalasserry, kerala$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Roopesh$pvg$, $pvg$I am very happy and a satisfied customer. The quality of the gem which I purchased was the same which i saw from the website. The interaction and communication was awesome from purevedicgems. I can suggest purevedicgems to those who wish to wear gemstones and fullfill their requirements.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/roopesh-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Roopesh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/roopesh/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 30, '2016-09-21T00:00:00Z'),
