  ('alex-moy', $pvg$Alex Moy$pvg$, $pvg$MALAYSIA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Alex Moy$pvg$, $pvg$ALL MY QUESTIONS WAS ANSWERED PROMPTLY THE SELLER IS VERY FRIENDLY THE SELLER WAS VERY HONEST AND SINCERE, HE CHOOSE FOR ME THE FEW GEMS BASED ON QUALITY AND ACCORDING TO MY REQUIREMENTS, INSTEAD ON MAXIMISING HIS SALES  HIS WORKMANSHIP FOR THE PENDANT AND RINGS IS JUST PERFECT SHIPMENT IS FAST THE SELLER COMMUNICATE AT EVERY STEP WITH PICTURES  THE GEMS IS VERY GOOD QUALITY AND AT A VERY REASONABLE PRICE THANK YOU.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/alex-moy-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Alex Moy$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/alex-moy/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 33, '2016-10-24T00:00:00Z'),
