  ('himanshu-kalra', $pvg$Himanshu Kalra$pvg$, $pvg$Gurgaon$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Himanshu Kalra$pvg$, $pvg$Service is very good.Specially the flexibility provided to the customers from ring design to stone varieties. Liked it very much.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/himanshu-kalra-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Himanshu Kalra$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/himanshu-kalra/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 36, '2016-11-27T00:00:00Z'),
  ('vijay-kavdia', $pvg$vijay kavdia$pvg$, $pvg$Rajasthan$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by vijay kavdia$pvg$, $pvg$Hello, I am happy to get a Quality south sea pearl and also the advice of vikasji and contents of your website are highly useful to gain an insight and select an appropriate gemstone.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/vijay-kavdia-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from vijay kavdia$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/vijay-kavdia/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 37, '2016-12-09T00:00:00Z'),
