  ('sunil', $pvg$Sunil$pvg$, $pvg$NOIDA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sunil$pvg$, $pvg$Vikas jis knowledge seems v good. Pure Vedic Gems team was very polite & professional. All good, wud come back for future needs.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sunil-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sunil$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sunil/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 45, '2018-07-27T00:00:00Z'),
  ('b-c-mahapatra', $pvg$B C MAHAPATRA$pvg$, $pvg$MUMBAI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by B C MAHAPATRA$pvg$, $pvg$The overall service is very good . Pure Vedic Gems team and the chairman are very good to interact with . The dispatch was very prompt . The quality also seems good . As there are no set method to find the effectiveness of a particular Gem stone , it will be basically experience based and how one will interpret it . Overall good and enjoyable experience with Pure Vedic people$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/b-c-mahapatra-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from B C MAHAPATRA$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/b-c-mahapatra/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 46, '2018-07-27T00:00:00Z'),
  ('anagha', $pvg$Anagha$pvg$, $pvg$PORTLAND, U.S.A$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Anagha$pvg$, $pvg$As recommended by Astrologer, I purchased the gemstones. I must say that they have a Unique role. After 3 months of wearing them, intuitively these have guided me in the right direction and given me a lot of strength in my convictions and getting beyond false sense of securities in life. Rest future will tell, how these prisms actually affect one. I am grateful to Vikas Mehra Ji for his time, his advice and detailed and patient way of dealing with customers. Thank you! Regards$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/anagha-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Anagha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/anagha/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 47, '2018-08-10T00:00:00Z'),
  ('rishi', $pvg$Rishi$pvg$, $pvg$Gurgoan$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Rishi$pvg$, $pvg$It is a nice, original ,of a very high quality. Thanks$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/rishi-proof.png', $pvg$Proof from Rishi$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/rishi/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 48, '2018-08-10T00:00:00Z'),
  ('ravi-mishra', $pvg$Ravi Mishra$pvg$, $pvg$GUJARAT$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Ravi Mishra$pvg$, $pvg$I was advised to wear an Opal of 7 Carats or above after consultation. I purchased it from Pure Vedic Gems. The quality of the stone is top notch with all the test certificates of the stone. Their gemstone collection do offer a wide range of products so that a patron can choose what he/she prefers.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/ravi-mishra-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Ravi Mishra$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/ravi-mishra/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 49, '2018-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
  ('rahul', $pvg$Rahul$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Rahul$pvg$, $pvg$Overall a good experience...the staff/ sales people were knowledgeable and patient...they answered all my questions and clarified any queries / doubts that I had...the stone range was quite diverse in price range so could easily select according to my budget...further they gave certificate from govt lab along with gemstone.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/rahul-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Rahul$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/rahul/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 50, '2018-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
  ('sunil-kalwani', $pvg$Sunil Kalwani$pvg$, $pvg$Los Angeles, (U.S.A)$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sunil Kalwani$pvg$, $pvg$The service was wonderful. Delivery and updates were very prompt and the pictures were incredibly appreciated. The ring itself has been fantastic. I wear it everyday and can feel the effects of it. Very grateful to have found you and will recommend you to friends looking for gamestones and use your service for any of my own future needs!$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sunil-kalwani-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sunil Kalwani$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sunil-kalwani/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 51, '2018-11-30T00:00:00Z'),
  ('amit-maurya', $pvg$AMIT MAURYA$pvg$, $pvg$Varanasi ( India)$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by AMIT MAURYA$pvg$, $pvg$It was great experience with \\\"Pure Vedic Gems team\\\" my sales representative who has suggested, recommended as well as guided for picking up the best items under my budget from beginning. Finally i had purchased 3 gems- Yellow Sapphire, Red Coral & Pearl with complete set of rings made with it & energization pooja. It was timely delivery of items with true, fair & transparent deal having with your team.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/amit-maurya-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from AMIT MAURYA$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/amit-maurya/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 52, '2018-12-07T00:00:00Z'),
