  ('shweta', $pvg$Shweta$pvg$, $pvg$Sydney$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Shweta$pvg$, $pvg$It was great talking to Vikas, I found him very knowledgeable, and he helped me choose the right product. Pure Vedic Gems team equally is very very helpful, He always sorted out all my quaries & was very responsive.I received the product on time & its a wonderful peace of gem. One doesnâ€™t need to worry about productâ€™s authenticity when buying from Purevedicgems.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/shweta-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Shweta$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/shweta/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 58, '2019-04-07T00:00:00Z'),
  ('m-bakeer', $pvg$M Bakeer$pvg$, $pvg$Nepean (Canada)$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by M Bakeer$pvg$, $pvg$Right away as soon as I started my order i was contacted by pure vedic gems team to make sure everything was set up perfectly for my ring to be made. They walked me through the whole process up to delivery. The stone was very good quality and well energized and I felt the difference as soon as I started wearing it. The craftsmanship of the ring was great aswell. I am grateful to have found purevedicgems and I cant wait to make my next purchase :)$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/m-bakeer-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from M Bakeer$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/m-bakeer/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 59, '2019-04-11T00:00:00Z'),
  ('narinder-tandon', $pvg$NARINDER TANDON$pvg$, $pvg$Jamu & Kashmir (India)$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by NARINDER TANDON$pvg$, $pvg$l got very satisfactory gem recommendation and then bought Red coral from here.Now l am feeling a positive change in myself. l highly recommend to everyone looking for genuine Govt.certified gemstone at affordable prices.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/narinder-tandon-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from NARINDER TANDON$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/narinder-tandon/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 60, '2019-04-14T00:00:00Z'),
  ('vaibhav', $pvg$Vaibhav$pvg$, $pvg$Wayle Nagar-Mumbai$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Vaibhav$pvg$, $pvg$If you are looking for genuine gemstones then purevedicgems is the only place where you can get it.I have purchased many gemstones from various online sites but the result of the gemstone was zero.Recently purchased Hakik from purevedic and its results are amazing.Thanks purevedic keep the good work going$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/vaibhav-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Vaibhav$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/vaibhav/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 61, '2019-04-19T00:00:00Z'),
