  ('balachandran-n', $pvg$BALACHANDRAN N$pvg$, $pvg$TAMILNADU-INDIA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by BALACHANDRAN N$pvg$, $pvg$I have purchased yellow sapphire of 3.7 carats from Pure Vedic Gems. The gem stone is superb, with very good quality, with reasonable price. Pure Vedic Gems Team, from the company provide necessary support, and provide necessary information regarding the Gem Stone and i received the gemstone safely, at proper time. Thanks a lot$pvg$, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/balachandran-n/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 66, '2019-07-17T00:00:00Z'),
  ('nitin', $pvg$Nitin$pvg$, $pvg$UK$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Nitin$pvg$, $pvg$Hi Vikasji, Its my pleasure to write feedback about the interaction that we had. I am very impress with the quality of the gemstone, reasonable pricing, finishing and perfection with with it is embedded into ring. The overall services such as - day to day interaction , resolving queries with quick responses and delivery on time in secure packing. I had received excellent customer service for first purchase of a another gemstone last year, the same experience this time as well. I would continue to use Purevedic for future purchases and would highly recommend to others.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/nitin-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Nitin$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/nitin/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 67, '2019-08-02T00:00:00Z'),
  ('divya', $pvg$Divya$pvg$, $pvg$BANGALORE$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Divya$pvg$, $pvg$Hi Pure Vedic Gems Team, I received the gem on Saturday. Its more beautiful than what I had expected. The gem definitely has a yellowish tinge and is very beautiful:-). I am very thankful to you for helping me purchase. I had an awesome shopping experience with Pure Vedic Gems. In a nutshell, I had the best customer experience. Not only is the gem of superior quality at a reasonable price but also I received the package on time. The packing was extremely well done. I will always shop from you people when ever I intend to buy gems in the future. God bless you all!$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/divya-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Divya$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/divya/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 68, '2019-11-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('b-naemeh', $pvg$B Naemeh$pvg$, $pvg$ARUNACHAL PRADESH$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by B Naemeh$pvg$, $pvg$The product delivered was 100% original and authentic, the ring was beautifully crafted and in all the process Mr. Vikas Mehra was very prompt and instrumental till the end. The most commendable part is the refund of excess amount that got deducted due to undeliberate error in gst. Hope the team of Purevedicgems always keep up the expectations and never break the trust of the customer. Good luck.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/b-naemeh-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from B Naemeh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/b-naemeh/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 69, '2019-11-21T00:00:00Z'),
  ('ajaz-hakim', $pvg$Ajaz Hakim$pvg$, $pvg$MAHARASHTRA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Ajaz Hakim$pvg$, $pvg$With all the authentic and certified products, I feel Pure Vedic Gems is the best platform to buy gemstones and related astrological products. I am really thankful to Vikas Mehra ji and the team, especially Pure Vedic Gems Team who guided me to buy the best gemstones and answered all the queries, leaving no doubt in my mind. The gemstones and the rings and locket were just beautiful. The work was top class and I felt so happy when I received the products. I am very much satisfied with their services. Have no words! 5 Stars! I recommed Pure Vedic Gems when it comes to buying quality and authentic gemstones.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/ajaz-hakim-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Ajaz Hakim$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/ajaz-hakim/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 70, '2020-01-16T00:00:00Z'),
  ('kusum', $pvg$Kusum$pvg$, $pvg$ODISHA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Kusum$pvg$, $pvg$Product was the same as mentioned in pictures. Their staff is very responsible. They care for the delivered item should reach to the right hand. Their following up process from order to delivery of product was very appreciable.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/kusum-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Kusum$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/kusum/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 71, '2020-02-23T00:00:00Z'),
  ('naveen-ragavendran', $pvg$Naveen Ragavendran$pvg$, $pvg$CHENNAI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Naveen Ragavendran$pvg$, $pvg$We booked for two full consultation on Skype and the appointment was fixed with astrologer Mr. Vinayak Bhatt and overall we are satisfied with the session and service. Below are some feedback. a) On time and respect for each others time. b) Very precise to the point - No deviations c) Humble and listen to question that we ask and answers very clearly. d) Knows what he talks about and has in-depth knowledge on the subject e) Highly approachable and comfortable to speak with. Highly recommend his service and really appreciate it. Thank you so much for this opportunity. Thanks$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/naveen-ragavendran-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Naveen Ragavendran$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/naveen-ragavendran/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 72, '2020-09-24T00:00:00Z'),
