  ('dhiraj-s', $pvg$Dhiraj S$pvg$, $pvg$AUSTRALIA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Dhiraj S$pvg$, $pvg$I purchased Blue Sapphire and Emerald gemstone in silver ring along with Rudraksha from Pure Vedic Gems. My experience was quite good in dealing with Pure Vedic Gems Team. Customer service provided was excellent with genuine quality product and faster shipping. I strongly recommend Pure Vedic Gems to purchase astrological standard gems and rudraksha.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/dhiraj-s-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Dhiraj S$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/dhiraj-s/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 84, '2021-05-15T00:00:00Z'),
  ('arun-unnikrishnan', $pvg$Arun Unnikrishnan$pvg$, $pvg$KERALA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Arun Unnikrishnan$pvg$, $pvg$The team was very helpful throughout the process of selecting the pearl , size , ring size and until the packing I was follow up and got and the item meets my expectations. Thanks team all the best , keep good customer care as you are doing now , and continue the best practices of the process$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/arun-unnikrishnan-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Arun Unnikrishnan$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/arun-unnikrishnan/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 85, '2021-05-24T00:00:00Z'),
  ('greg-moratin', $pvg$Greg Moratin$pvg$, $pvg$PHILIPPINES$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Greg Moratin$pvg$, $pvg$Hi there, I already purchased twice, service was very good and Whatsapp conversation with Pure Vedic Gems Teams was very convenient. He would also answer my questions almost instantly. He is very patient and this is a very good customer service. The quality of the ruby and yellow sapphire that I purchased are unquestionable, I am so happy with my purchase. I was guided also of what to purchase via my vedic consultation with Vinayak. Overall, I am a satisfied customer! I will continue to purchase products for my family members in the coming months.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/greg-moratin-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Greg Moratin$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/greg-moratin/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 86, '2021-05-24T00:00:00Z'),
