  ('sanjay-kumar-singh', $pvg$Sanjay Kumar Singh$pvg$, $pvg$JHARKHAND$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sanjay Kumar Singh$pvg$, $pvg$I have purchased three gemstone from you, which name is already mentioned in the subject line of tge feedback form. Its really great and good quality gemstone. Staff are also cooperative espacially Pure Vedic Gems teams whom with i deal and communicate the respective gemstone. Thanks Pure Vedic Gems for your kind support and valuable suggestion and Cooperation at all time.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sanjay-kumar-singh-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sanjay Kumar Singh$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sanjay-kumar-singh/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 90, '2021-06-24T00:00:00Z'),
  ('partha-sarkar-2', $pvg$Partha Sarkar$pvg$, $pvg$SARDARNAGAR$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Partha Sarkar$pvg$, $pvg$Its very good quality, the gems knowledgeable persons I have shown they said good quality.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/partha-sarkar-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Partha Sarkar$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/partha-sarkar-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 91, '2021-07-17T00:00:00Z'),
  ('bibi-hazra', $pvg$Bibi Hazra$pvg$, $pvg$MAURITIUS$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Bibi Hazra$pvg$, $pvg$I bought 2 gemstones (Yellow Sapphire & Red Coral) from Pure Vedic Gems and I am very pleased with the products and customer services. The gemstones were high quality and very beautiful. PURE VEDIC GEMS teams was very helpful throughout the journey. He helped me from the purchase to delivery of the product. Thank you$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/bibi-hazra-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Bibi Hazra$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/bibi-hazra/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 92, '2021-07-17T00:00:00Z'),
  ('vinay-jadyar', $pvg$VINAY JADYAR$pvg$, $pvg$MUMBAI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by VINAY JADYAR$pvg$, $pvg$Pure Vedic Gems really work with pure passion and quality services in gems industry. Supporting team is very co-operative. Their advices and suggestions are very accurate on our problems. Their products are genuine, perfectly tested and checked from approved Gems Lab passes all norms and conditions. I bought BLUE SAPPHIRE stone with ring and I am completely satisfied with this product.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/vinay-jadyar-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from VINAY JADYAR$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/vinay-jadyar/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 93, '2021-07-17T00:00:00Z'),
