  ('dhiraj-shrivastava', $pvg$Dhiraj Shrivastava$pvg$, $pvg$AUSTRALIA$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Dhiraj Shrivastava$pvg$, $pvg$This is my fourth gemstone purchase from Pure Vedic Gems team. This particular purchase of mine was a top quality blue sapphire from exclusive gems section. I am very happy with the quality of gemstone, ring design, overall customer service and prompt delivery. I strongly recommend to anyone who is looking for gemstones to reach out to Vikas jee and team for a genuine vedic quality gemstone with reasonable price and excellent customer service.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/dhiraj-shrivastava-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Dhiraj Shrivastava$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/dhiraj-shrivastava/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 95, '2021-08-18T00:00:00Z'),
