  ('sanjeiiv', $pvg$Sanjeiiv$pvg$, $pvg$MUMBAI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Sanjeiiv$pvg$, $pvg$Very supportive staff. Explained everything about the product which helped a lot in deciding and choosing the right product as per budget. Resolved all the queries during the multiple discussions and very transparent dealing from discussions to sharing photos/videos and whatever I requested them. After receiving the product, I am totally satisfied with the quality of ring, stones and rudraksha. Thank you Team Pure Vedic. Keep up the good work.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/sanjeiiv-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Sanjeiiv$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/sanjeiiv/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 101, '2021-09-26T00:00:00Z'),
  ('praveen-kumar', $pvg$Praveen Kumar$pvg$, $pvg$Baraut, Uttar pradesh$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Praveen Kumar$pvg$, $pvg$Good quality and authentic product with auturised lab reports , Well behaved Staff and Owner . Satisfied.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/praveen-kumar-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Praveen Kumar$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/praveen-kumar/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 102, '2021-09-26T00:00:00Z'),
