  ('eve', $pvg$Eve$pvg$, $pvg$Malaysia$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Eve$pvg$, $pvg$Love the purchasing experience here. Very professional, very reassuring and every step was a pleasure.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/eve-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Eve$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/eve/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 105, '2021-09-26T00:00:00Z'),
  ('arun-2', $pvg$Arun$pvg$, $pvg$Nabha, Punjab$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Arun$pvg$, $pvg$Nicest website i have ever visited for the purchase of gemstones, the staff and the directors are exceptionally helpful, friendly and kind, their nice guidance has enabled me to purchase the best yellow sapphire in my selected budget, it wont be any exaggeration to say, that this type of quality and guidance, in such a price, such ease in making real purchases of those certified products, (which are sold with million types of scams everywhere), is not that common to see, one is fearful of fakeness everywhere, without any expertise in this field, its next to impossible to shop for genuine precious products, but their efficiency in quantity and quality has satisfied, by all means. i thank you by heart for everything above, and i am waiting to see the good positive results of their products that i have bought, they will always remain my first preference, whenever i plan to purchase any product or service related to astrological and energy fields some more filters and sorting options can be added to the list of products, to increase the ease of shopping thank you$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/arun-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Arun$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/arun-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 106, '2021-09-28T00:00:00Z'),
  ('isabella-malherbe', $pvg$Isabella Malherbe$pvg$, $pvg$Singapore$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Isabella Malherbe$pvg$, $pvg$We bought a ring and a pendant. Everything was good. Pure Vedic Gems Team was giving a very professional service and the products arrived promptly. Thank you very much for all your help and will come back to you whenever needed.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/isabella-malherbe-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Isabella Malherbe$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/isabella-malherbe/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 107, '2021-10-12T00:00:00Z'),
  ('aravind', $pvg$ARAVIND$pvg$, $pvg$Singapore$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by ARAVIND$pvg$, $pvg$I have purchased emerald gemstone with silver ring from here. The quality of the gem is good. Ring also well made. Shipping was also fast. Overall a pleasant experience.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/aravind-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from ARAVIND$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/aravind/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 108, '2021-10-12T00:00:00Z'),
  ('gaurav-kapoor-2', $pvg$Gaurav Kapoor$pvg$, $pvg$DELHI-NCR$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Gaurav Kapoor$pvg$, $pvg$Geniune emerald and good service at Decent price. Recommended. Thank you$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/gaurav-kapoor-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Gaurav Kapoor$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/gaurav-kapoor-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 109, '2021-10-12T00:00:00Z'),
