  ('jitin', $pvg$Jitin$pvg$, $pvg$Meera Bagh$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Jitin$pvg$, $pvg$Thanx Pure Vedic Gems team for this beautiful product I liked it specially the design in silver caping done by pure vedic gems I searched many other sites which were giving same certificate in more then double rate guys must visit pure vedic gems$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/jitin-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Jitin$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/jitin/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 153, '2023-01-17T00:00:00Z'),
