  ('shyamsundar-k', $pvg$Shyamsundar.k$pvg$, $pvg$Chennai$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Shyamsundar.k$pvg$, $pvg$After providing birth details they suggested 3 mukhi rudraksha along with other gem stones. As im already wearing gem stones i opted 3 mukhi rudraksha. After ordering it came. I wearing 3 mukhi rudraksha about a month. Thanks for suggestion.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/shyamsundar-k-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Shyamsundar.k$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/shyamsundar-k/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 157, '2023-05-29T00:00:00Z'),
  ('pola', $pvg$Pola$pvg$, $pvg$London$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Pola$pvg$, $pvg$Yes, I totally loved the time and â€œearsâ€ given to me to understand my wish. I felt in good hands and very respected. I felt your care and genuine patience. Because of all this you were the 1st shop I bought my gemstone ring whilst Being overseas. I will def go back to get another stone soon! Your service is diamond! Thank you.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/pola-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Pola$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/pola/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 158, '2023-05-29T00:00:00Z'),
  ('amit-adiraju', $pvg$Amit Adiraju$pvg$, $pvg$Dougherty Rd$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Amit Adiraju$pvg$, $pvg$The scheduling was perfect , pandits did the entire shanti process in a pure Vedic way, did the chanting with perfection and focus. arrangements were aesthetically pleasing. Watched live the entire process, I could also see positive aspects of graha shanti within 2-3 days. Overall, very satisfied with process and results. Worth the price.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/amit-adiraju-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Amit Adiraju$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/amit-adiraju/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 159, '2023-05-29T00:00:00Z'),
  ('tomas', $pvg$Tomas$pvg$, NULL, $pvg$Testimonial by Tomas$pvg$, $pvg$Really good customer service through whatsapp! Really helpful and always available for questions! Iâ€™m definitely buying here again.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/tomas-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Tomas$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/tomas/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 160, '2023-05-29T00:00:00Z'),
  ('satya', $pvg$Satya$pvg$, $pvg$Siwan, Bihar$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Satya$pvg$, $pvg$Good quality products$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/satya-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Satya$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/satya/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 161, '2023-05-29T00:00:00Z'),
  ('shristi-sinha', $pvg$Shristi Sinha$pvg$, $pvg$Chapra, Bihar$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Shristi Sinha$pvg$, $pvg$Gems and rudrakshas from pure vedic gems are authentic and certified. They have their effect prominently and the customer service is also very good.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/shristi-sinha-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Shristi Sinha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/shristi-sinha/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 162, '2023-06-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('ashique-hussain', $pvg$Ashique Hussain$pvg$, $pvg$Guwahati$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Ashique Hussain$pvg$, $pvg$Wonderful hub for gemstone purchasing at affordable cost.... Best quality gemstone sold by pure vedic gems.....$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/ashique-hussain-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Ashique Hussain$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/ashique-hussain/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 163, '2023-06-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('vaibhav-lalka', $pvg$Vaibhav Lalka$pvg$, NULL, $pvg$Testimonial by Vaibhav Lalka$pvg$, $pvg$The service is very good and products are original Very much credible team$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/vaibhav-lalka-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Vaibhav Lalka$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/vaibhav-lalka/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 164, '2023-06-13T00:00:00Z'),
  ('dhananjay-sinha', $pvg$Dhananjay Sinha$pvg$, $pvg$Patna, Bihar$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Dhananjay Sinha$pvg$, $pvg$I am Dhananjay Sinha from Patna, and I have been a loyal customer of PureVedicGems since 2021. My special connection with them involves visiting their Noida store for gemstone and rudrakshas purchases, where I had the pleasure of interacting with their exceptional team. In particular, PureVedicGems Teams stood out with his heartwarming nature and ever-present smile, earning my sincere appreciation. Meeting the owner, Mr. Vikash, was a delightful experience as his kindness and professionalism perfectly aligned with the high standards of the team. Recently, I purchased a rudraksha with a pendant, and I eagerly look forward to making more purchases from them. PureVedicGems has truly earned my trust and loyalty. Sincerely, Dhananjay Sinha$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/dhananjay-sinha-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Dhananjay Sinha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/dhananjay-sinha/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 165, '2023-10-22T00:00:00Z'),
  ('shantanu-khambete', $pvg$Shantanu khambete$pvg$, $pvg$Maharashtra$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Shantanu khambete$pvg$, $pvg$I was given good advice by the staff and staff was very humble to me. The above mentioned products (gemstones and rudraksh)are helping me to overcome my confidence level. Thank you Pure Vedic gems.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/shantanu-khambete-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Shantanu khambete$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/shantanu-khambete/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 166, '2023-10-27T00:00:00Z'),
  ('anagha-2', $pvg$Anagha$pvg$, $pvg$California$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Anagha$pvg$, $pvg$Having known Pure Vedic Gems for a very long time when it was time to recommend astrological gem remedies to friends, Pure Vedic Gems stood up first in mind. They are prompt, authentic and courteous and communicate in responsive details. They are also downright honest and will not sell any damaged products. Pure Vedic Gems Team conveyed to me that the gemstone chosen has accidentally been damaged and there was a lookout for new one. Vikas Mehra Ji was guiding the team to communicate this error and rectify with a new stone, we hope to continue purchasing from Pure Vedic and feel assured with their guidance. Thank You Pure Vedic Gems Team and Vikasji.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/anagha-2-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Anagha$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/anagha-2/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 167, '2023-11-24T00:00:00Z'),
  ('lakshmi', $pvg$Lakshmi$pvg$, $pvg$Chennai$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Lakshmi$pvg$, $pvg$Good quality ring, the astrologer patiently explained everything and delivery was prompt as well$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/lakshmi-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Lakshmi$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/lakshmi/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 168, '2023-11-25T00:00:00Z'),
  ('syed-saqib-ahmed', $pvg$Syed Saqib Ahmed$pvg$, $pvg$Gorewada square$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Syed Saqib Ahmed$pvg$, $pvg$Good quality gems and nice customer service$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/syed-saqib-ahmed-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Syed Saqib Ahmed$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/syed-saqib-ahmed/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 169, '2023-11-25T00:00:00Z'),
  ('mukesh-tiwari', $pvg$Mukesh Tiwari$pvg$, $pvg$India$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Mukesh Tiwari$pvg$, $pvg$Very much satisfied and they have gone beyond there boundaries to help me with the boundaries.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/mukesh-tiwari-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Mukesh Tiwari$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/mukesh-tiwari/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 170, '2023-12-04T00:00:00Z'),
  ('samrat-ghose', $pvg$Samrat Ghose$pvg$, $pvg$GUWAHATI$pvg$, $pvg$Testimonial by Samrat Ghose$pvg$, $pvg$The customer support is very good. Pure Vedic Gems Team has been very cordial and cooperative throughout the entire process from selection of the gemstone to sending it through courier. Every queries are being looked into and addressed properly by Pure Vedic Gems Team. Kudos to the Pure Vedic team!!!$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/samrat-ghose-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Samrat Ghose$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/samrat-ghose/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 171, '2023-12-04T00:00:00Z'),
  ('naga-baireddy', $pvg$Naga Baireddy$pvg$, NULL, $pvg$Testimonial by Naga Baireddy$pvg$, $pvg$I have purchased customized pendant with coral and pearl. They have provided the pricing upfront and very transparent. This is my second time purchasing with pure vedic gems.$pvg$, '/legacy/testimonials/naga-baireddy-proof.jpg', $pvg$Proof from Naga Baireddy$pvg$, 'https://www.purevedicgems.com/testimonial/naga-baireddy/', 5, 'approved', true, false, 172, '2023-12-26T00:00:00Z'),
